SHABBAR KA JANAZA JAATA HAIN AUR TEER LAYEEN BARSAAT E HAIN <br>
ABBAS KE BADLEY HAI TEWAR SHABBIR UNHE SAMJATE HAI<br>
<br>
1. BHAI KI WASIYAT PAR HUMKO KARNA HAI AMAL AYE MERE JARI <br>
 YUN SABR O REZA KI MANZIL PAR SHAMSHEER NAHI CHAMKATEY HAI<br>
<br>
2. TABOOTE HASSAN PAR TEEROUN KI BOHCHAR JO KARTEY HAI AADAA <br>
 YEH ZULM TO KAFIR BHI NA KAREN MAYYAT PA LAYEEN JO DHATEY HAI<br>
<br>
3. PEHLOO MEIN NAWASA DAFAN NA HO NANA KE JI KEHTEY HAI AADAA<br>
 WO ROOHE NABI O ZEHRA KO MARQAD MEIN BOHAT TADPATEY HAI<br>
<br>
4. DAFANA KE HASSAN KE LAASHEY KO KADMOO MEIN JANAB E ZEHRA KE <br>
 TURBAT PE HASSAN KE SIBTEY NABI AANKHOUN SE LAHOO BARSAATEY HAI<br>
<br>
5. THA ZEHER SE TUKDEY QALB E HASSAN PHIR ISPE CHALAYE TEER E SITAM <br>
 ROO ROO KE NABI KE ROUZE PAR YEH SIBTE NABI FARMATEY HAI<br>
<br>
6. AATHARA BANI HASHIM KE JIGAR IS GHAM SE HOWE TUKDEY MAZHER <br>
 MAYYAT KO KISI KI SOUCHO ZARA DOBAAR KOI NEHLAATEY HA<br>
<br>
